   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb n="1" xml:id="pb-1r-trl" facs="berkeley:recid:85279-62.recto.infrared_ii.jpg/full/full/0/default.jpg"/>
            <ab xml:id="MP0067_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>(R) PWN GṬk' Y nywk' mdyʾncykʾn Y BYRḤ hw[rdṭ
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>Y ŠNṬ $X-IIII-IIII ʾwcynyṭ Y dwṭk' Y yẕdʾnpʾ(n)[k'
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>Y̱LYDWNṭ hlṭ-wndʾṭ ʾwsṭʾndʾl lʾd ʿL bwn' Y chʾlbwhṭ' Y
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>PWN nywbyhkʾn MN plyk' Y PWN nmywl dʾlyk ḤG
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>G-I-C $$$$X ○ G-$$X ○ G-$$X ○ G-$$X ○
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>○○ MN plyk' gwsp̄nd-I Y $X-III-III kwṭk' ○ (space)
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/>○○ ʿL bwn' Y pylwc' Y PWN ʾnʾlklʾn MN plhw' Y
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trl-p1-l8"/>PWN nmywl dʾlyk gwsp̄nd-XI ○ dʾšn' Y PWN bg
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trl-p1-l9"/>Y mṭr' lʾd gwsp̄nd-II ○ ʾyʾlyṭ' Y Kʾl myl lʾd
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trl-p1-l10"/>I ○ MN ʾḤRN kʾm Y zʾṭʾnplhw' Y kʾlplmʾn hwkck' Y lykʾn(?)
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trl-p1-l11"/>II ○ bldʾn I ○ sp̄yṭpʾk III ○ mwlw' III-III ○ mwlwl(ck'?)
               <lb n="12" xml:id="trl-p1-l12"/>$-IIII-III ○ MN mškʾn ḤYṬYWNṭ ṬWRʾ-I Y I-C-$$X-I[   (space)
               <lb n="13" xml:id="trl-p1-l13"/>○○ W ʾlṭ Y ḤG MN bwn' Y nhcylkʾn dʾt <gap extent="several words" reason="tear"/>
               <lb n="14" xml:id="trl-p1-l14"/><gap extent="several words" reason="tear"/> I ○ ʾyʾly<supplied resp="#DW">ṭ' Y</supplied> kʾl <gap extent="several words" reason="tear"/>
               <lb n="15" xml:id="trl-p1-l15"/><gap extent="several words" reason="tear"/>
            </ab>
            <pb n="2" xml:id="pb-1v-trl" facs="berkeley:recid:85279-62.verso.infrared_ii.jpg/full/full/0/default.jpg"/>
            <ab xml:id="MP0067_trl-p2">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p2-l1"/>(V) ʾwcyṭ' Y glmyh Y BYRḤ hwrdṭ Y ŠNṬ $X-IIII-IIII
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP0067_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>(R) pad nāmag ī nēk mayānǰīgān ī māh Ho[rdād
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>ī sāl 38 uzēnīd ī dūdag ī yazdānbānag
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>zād xrad-windād ōstāndār rāy ō bun ī Čahārbōxt
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>pad Nēwbēhagān az Friyag ī pad Namēwar dārīg gandum
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>g(rīw) 190 ○ g(rīw) 50 ○ g(rīw) 50 ○ g(rīw) 50 ○
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>○○ az Friyag gōspand 1 ī 36 kōdag ○ (space)
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/>○○ ō bun ī Pērōz ī pad Anārgarān az Farrox ī
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trc-p1-l8"/>pad Namēwar dārīg gōspand 11 ○ dāšn ī pad bay
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trc-p1-l9"/>ī Mihr rāy gōspand 2 ○ ayārīd ī kār Amīr rāy
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trc-p1-l10"/>1 ○ az any kām ī Zādānfarrox ī kārframān xūkčak ī Rēgān(?)
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trc-p1-l11"/>2 ○ briyān 1 ○ spēdbāg 3 ○ murw 6 ○ murw(čak?)
               <lb n="12" xml:id="trc-p1-l12"/>27 ○ az Maškān ōnīd gāw 1 ī 151[   (space)
               <lb n="13" xml:id="trc-p1-l13"/>○○ ud ārd ī gandum az bun ī Naxčīragān <gap extent="several words" reason="tear"/>
               <lb n="14" xml:id="trc-p1-l14"/><gap extent="several words" reason="tear"/> 1 ○ ayārī<supplied resp="#DW">d ī</supplied> kār <gap extent="several words" reason="tear"/>
               <lb n="15" xml:id="trc-p1-l15"/><gap extent="several words" reason="tear"/>
            </ab>
            <ab xml:id="MP0067_trc-p2">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p2-l1"/>(V) uzīd ī garmīh ī māh Hordād ī sāl 38
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP0067_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>As document of the goods: the mediators of month Ho[rdād]
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>of the year 38: on behalf of the expenses of the family of
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>the ōstāndār, born with inherited knowledge, to the bun of Čaharbōxt of
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>Nēwbēhgān from Friyag who is manage in Namēwar, wheat
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trans-p1-l5"/>grīw 190, grīw 50, grīw 50.
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trans-p1-l6"/>From Friyag 1 sheep out of 36 lambs.
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trans-p1-l7"/>To the bun of Pērōz in Anārgarān form Farrox,
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trans-p1-l8"/>the manager in Namēwar, 11 sheep. On behalf of the gift for God
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trans-p1-l9"/>Mihr 2 sheep. On behalf of the Amīr, who evaluated the action
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trans-p1-l10"/>1 [sheep]. From another purpose of Zādānfarrox, the overseer, piglets of Rēgān(?)
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trans-p1-l11"/>2. 1 Biryānī. 3 curd (soups?). 6 birds, small birds (?)
               <lb n="12" xml:id="trans-p1-l12"/>27. From Maškān 1 ox was brought out of 151[ ].
               <lb n="13" xml:id="trans-p1-l13"/>And wheat flour from the bun of Naxčīragān <gap extent="several words" reason="tear"/>
               <lb n="14" xml:id="trans-p1-l14"/><gap extent="several words" reason="tear"/>
               <lb n="15" xml:id="trans-p1-l15"/><gap extent="several words" reason="tear"/>
            </ab>
            <ab xml:id="MP0067_trans-p2">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p2-l1"/>(V): Gone out from the *bath-house, month Hordād of the year 38.
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>